  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture/Food Production Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kowdinasyon pou Developman Solid Sids (KODESS) will work to further develop four grassroots groups in Haitis Southeast department, to ensure a more reliable food source and reduce vulnerability to natural disasters. Approximately 1,500 residents of the communities of Bainet, La Valle, Meyer and Montagne La Voute in Jacmel will benefit directly and another 3,150 will benefit indirectly.</narrative>
